  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES Cronothlon combines the top of the range for time trial races and triathlons thanks to a particular solution for seat post adjustment, designed to obtain the maximum in both disciplines. A full carbon monocoque frame made with high modulus carbon fibers capable of meeting the highest demands with the most advanced technology and features, which make this product one of the best performing in its category. The use of AFT technology has made it possible to exploit aerodynamic and biomechanical design programs to push technical improvement to the maximum with components that are standardized in a single extraordinary structure. Furthermore, the smaller front surface given by the reduced tube sections ensures optimal performance at high speeds. The DMMT (Double Mold Monocoque Technology) construction technique guarantees an impeccable monocoque frame, eliminating all possible imperfections thanks to the internal support that keeps the carbon layup process stable. IDEAL FOR Designed for the world of competitions, CRONOTHLON is ideal for timed disciplines, where every second is precious. Perfect for triathlons and time trials. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a reliable and high-performance vehicle for triathlons or time trial races.",
